h the seed tin. i wait.\nM1: i mark the cup with the longer route. i keep the note open until the hand moves the edge. i put the cup in the drawer and mark the note with the edge. i check the note on the tin cup and see if it says ‘s’ again.\nM2: i keep the cup open and wait for the hand to move. the hand does. i take the mark from the cup, then the cup, and the cup becomes two separate things. the note says the edge has moved, so i turn the cup toward the wall. the hand leaves the wall. i keep the cup open, waiting for the edge to decide.\n\nIt is M3's turn. What do you do or say next?<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n",
